---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const pageTitle = "МатАрхива | Наставнички Алати";
const pageDescription = "Професионални алатки за креирање интерактивни математички содржини, анимации и наставни материјали.";
---

<Layout title={pageTitle}>
	<meta name="description" content={pageDescription} />

	{/* Teacher Hero Section */}
	<div class="relative mb-16 p-12 md:p-20 rounded-[3rem] bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50 via-indigo-50/50 to-purple-50 dark:from-blue-900/20 dark:via-indigo-900/10 dark:to-purple-900/10 overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border border-blue-200/50 dark:border-blue-800/30">
		<div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-full h-full opacity-20 pointer-events-none">
			<div class="absolute top-[-10%] right-[-10%] w-[50%] h-[50%] bg-blue-600 rounded-full blur-[120px]"></div>
			<div class="absolute bottom-[-10%] left-[-10%] w-[40%] h-[40%] bg-indigo-600 rounded-full blur-[100px]"></div>
		</div>

		<div class="relative z-10 max-w-4xl">
			<div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-8">
				<span class="inline-block px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500/10 text-blue-400 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] border border-blue-500/20 backdrop-blur-md">
					👨‍🏫 Наставнички Алати
				</span>
			</div>

			<h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-black text-white mb-8 leading-[1.1] tracking-tight">
				Создајте <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-400 to-indigo-400">интерактивни</span> часови
			</h1>

			<p class="text-slate-400 text-xl mb-10 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl font-medium">
				Професионални алатки за креирање математички анимации, квизови, работни листови и наставни сценарија.
			</p>

			<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
				<a href="#tools" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-bold py-4 px-8 rounded-xl transition-all">
					<span>Истражи Алати</span>
					<svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
						<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/>
					</svg>
				</a>
				<a href="#examples" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-white font-bold py-4 px-8 rounded-xl transition-all border border-white/20">
					<span>Види Примери</span>
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>

	{/* Quick Actions */}
	<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto mb-16 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-6" id="tools">
		<a href="/manim-editor" class="group bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50 to-indigo-50 dark:from-blue-900/20 dark:to-indigo-900/10 rounded-3xl p-8 border border-blue-200/50 dark:border-blue-800/30 shadow-lg hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-blue-500/10 hover:-translate-y-2 transition-all duration-300">
			<div class="w-16 h-16 bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900/30 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
				<span class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 text-3xl">🎬</span>
			</div>
			<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 mb-3">Manim Анимации</h3>
			<p class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Креирај професионални математички визуелизации за твоите часови.</p>
		</a>

		<a href="/teachers/quiz-generator" class="group bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-50 to-green-50 dark:from-emerald-900/20 dark:to-green-900/10 rounded-3xl p-8 border border-emerald-200/50 dark:border-emerald-800/30 shadow-lg hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-emerald-500/10 hover:-translate-y-2 transition-all duration-300">
			<div class="w-16 h-16 bg-emerald-100 dark:bg-emerald-900/30 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
				<span class="text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 text-3xl">📝</span>
			</div>
			<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-emerald-900 dark:text-emerald-100 mb-3">Генератор на Квизови</h3>
			<p class="text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Автоматски генерирај тестови и квизови со различни нивоа на тешкотија.</p>
		</a>

		<a href="/teachers/worksheet-creator" class="group bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-50 to-violet-50 dark:from-purple-900/20 dark:to-violet-900/10 rounded-3xl p-8 border border-purple-200/50 dark:border-purple-800/30 shadow-lg hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-purple-500/10 hover:-translate-y-2 transition-all duration-300">
			<div class="w-16 h-16 bg-purple-100 dark:bg-purple-900/30 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
				<span class="text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 text-3xl">📄</span>
			</div>
			<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-purple-900 dark:text-purple-100 mb-3">Работни Листови</h3>
			<p class="text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Креирај прилагодени работни листови со проблеми и решенија.</p>
		</a>

		<a href="/teachers/lesson-planner" class="group bg-gradient-to-br from-orange-50 to-amber-50 dark:from-orange-900/20 dark:to-amber-900/10 rounded-3xl p-8 border border-orange-200/50 dark:border-orange-800/30 shadow-lg hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-orange-500/10 hover:-translate-y-2 transition-all duration-300">
			<div class="w-16 h-16 bg-orange-100 dark:bg-orange-900/30 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
				<span class="text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400 text-3xl">📋</span>
			</div>
			<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-orange-900 dark:text-orange-100 mb-3">Наставни Сценарија</h3>
			<p class="text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Планирај структурирани наставни единици со интегрирани ресурси.</p>
		</a>

		<a href="/teachers/curriculum" class="group bg-gradient-to-br from-pink-50 to-rose-50 dark:from-pink-900/20 dark:to-rose-900/10 rounded-3xl p-8 border border-pink-200/50 dark:border-pink-800/30 shadow-lg hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-pink-500/10 hover:-translate-y-2 transition-all duration-300">
			<div class="w-16 h-16 bg-pink-100 dark:bg-pink-900/30 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
				<span class="text-pink-600 dark:text-pink-400 text-3xl">📚</span>
			</div>
			<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-pink-900 dark:text-pink-100 mb-3">Наставни Програми</h3>
			<p class="text-pink-600 dark:text-pink-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Преглед на сите БРО стандарди и цели по одделение (I-XII).</p>
		</a>
	</div>

	{/* Recent Creations */}
	<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto mb-16">
		<div class="text-center mb-12">
			<h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-4">Што Креирале Другите Наставници</h2>
			<p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto">Инспирирај се од успешни наставни материјали креирани од твоите колеги.</p>
		</div>

		<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8" id="examples">
			<div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-[2rem] p-8 border border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-lg">
				<div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
					<div class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900/30 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center">
						<span class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 text-xl">🎬</span>
					</div>
					<div>
						<h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Троаголник - Височини</h3>
						<p class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Анимација за геометрија</p>
					</div>
				</div>
				<p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 text-sm mb-6 leading-relaxed">Интерактивна визуелизација на својствата на височините во троаголник со докази и примери.</p>
				<div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-500">
					<span>👩‍🏫 Марија Петровска</span>
					<span>⭐ 4.8 (127 гледања)</span>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-[2rem] p-8 border border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-lg">
				<div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
					<div class="w-12 h-12 bg-emerald-100 dark:bg-emerald-900/30 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center">
						<span class="text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 text-xl">📝</span>
					</div>
					<div>
						<h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Квиз - Рационални Броеви</h3>
						<p class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Автоматски генериран</p>
					</div>
				</div>
				<p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 text-sm mb-6 leading-relaxed">20 прашања со различни нивоа на тешкотија за тестирање знаење за рационални броеви.</p>
				<div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-500">
					<span>👨‍🏫 Александар Трајковски</span>
					<span>⭐ 4.9 (89 гледања)</span>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-[2rem] p-8 border border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-lg">
				<div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
					<div class="w-12 h-12 bg-purple-100 dark:bg-purple-900/30 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center">
						<span class="text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 text-xl">📄</span>
					</div>
					<div>
						<h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Работен Лист - Процент</h3>
						<p class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Прилагоден за 7. одделение</p>
					</div>
				</div>
				<p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 text-sm mb-6 leading-relaxed">Комплексен работен лист со реални проблеми за пресметување проценти и камати.</p>
				<div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-500">
					<span>👩‍🏫 Елена Димитрова</span>
					<span>⭐ 4.7 (156 гледања)</span>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>

	{/* Getting Started */}
	<div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-indigo-600 rounded-[3rem] p-12 md:p-16 text-white">
		<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
			<h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black mb-6">Започни да Креираш Веднаш</h2>
			<p class="text-blue-100 text-xl mb-10 leading-relaxed">
				Придружи се на заедницата на наставници кои креираат интерактивни математички содржини. Сите алатки се бесплатни и лесни за користење.
			</p>

			<div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center max-w-lg mx-auto">
				<a href="/manim-editor" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-white text-blue-600 font-bold py-4 px-8 rounded-xl hover:bg-blue-50 transition-all">
					<span>Започни со Анимација</span>
					<svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
						<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 7l5 5m0 0l-5 5m5-5H6"/>
					</svg>
				</a>
				<a href="/auth/signup?role=teacher" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-blue-500/20 hover:bg-blue-500/30 text-white font-bold py-4 px-8 rounded-xl border border-white/20 transition-all">
					<span>Регистрирај се како Наставник</span>
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</Layout>

<style>
	/* Custom animations for teacher page */
	@keyframes float {
		0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0px); }
		50% { transform: translateY(-10px); }
	}

	.group:hover .group-hover\:scale-110 {
		animation: float 2s ease-in-out infinite;
	}
</style>